  partName: Intake Runner
  description: The Intake Runner is a small, complex-shaped component situated at
    the top-left-front of the engine, serving as a conduit for air and fuel to flow
    into the cylinders. Its compact size and precise geometry enable it to efficiently
    direct the air-fuel mixture into the engine, contributing to improved performance
    and power output. An interesting aspect of the intake runner is its carefully
    designed internal surface finish, which helps to reduce turbulence and enhance
    airflow.
